<title>USA: Consolidated names treasurer.</title>
<headline>Consolidated names treasurer.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Freightways Inc said Thursday it has appointed R. Guy Kraines, currently the company's assistant treasurer, as treasurer.</p>
<p>Kraines, 46, will assume his new position after the previously announced spin-off of the company's largest subsidiary, CF MotorFreight, expected to be finalized by mid-November.</p>
<p>Kraines succeeds David Morrison who will become chief financial officer of CF MotorFreight, to be called Consolidated Freightways Corp after it becomes an independent, publicly traded entity.</p>
</text>
